{"v":4,"catch":"清理月球，組建你的太空小隊。\n一起採集更多月壤！","desc":"穿上太空衣，拿起吸塵器，看看你能收集多少月壤。把採集到的月壤賣掉，為下一次升級存下資金。\n\n用賺來的錢升級吸塵器、購買更大型的採集機具，還能雇用其他太空人一起工作。剛開始，你得靠一台吸塵器獨自作業。隨著遊戲進展，你將組建自己的小隊，添購更多機具，採集越來越多的月壤。\n\n你能把多大一片月球表面清理乾淨？","publisher":"DEV 666","release":"2026-11-26","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f80b8d8738840279c7ff6ad4deab533c5b90f0d87b294b1d2b60597753d0cb23.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e5830fb37ee52f98a51b23c20b5ac85b2e0744e3d254950feb714c7192991f5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26c7cd3c6716d55a93af4b4a7f4bc8142faa9072625c799d7373f3f62c23d51c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73eaabb39250ee0dd2fc569aeb3dc5ace6ea74ee9e1d7d1dc485926aec22df5a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/16a3b84e57b345030cf07b574375883b2a097d734ccf939ef5ae2489f604eff5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d6596d508746d166086ee7b779041f05c696697824891930284b18aa34e9bb8a.jpg"],"titleId":"01007c802b624000","dlc":[]}